TITLE:: RCOsc
summary:: OSC control surface of a song
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCSong, Classes/RCBeatSpec

DESCRIPTION::
Paths are code::/<song>/<instr>/<names...>:: and keys code::<song>_<instr>_<names...>::, exactly as the proto-library made them, so a Chataigne project built for it keeps working. A Symbol with underscores becomes nested segments (code::\start_normal:: → code::/start/normal::), an Array gives the segments, nil adds nothing. Handlers are guarded.

